{"duration_api_ms": 24628, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "95d95e4a-9874-47e7-bd00-e5e39457b63e", "total_cost_usd": 0.09685374500000002, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1951, "cache_read_input_tokens": 59058, "output_tokens": 458, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1951, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 346, "cache_read_input_tokens": 30035, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 939, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 939}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-sonnet-5-5": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 1425, "cacheReadInputTokens": 128050, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 16520, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.09315500000000002, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 8, "outputTokens": 2217, "cacheReadInputTokens": 58082, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 16069, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.003698745, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 300, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "origin": {"kind": "task-notification", "producer": "session-task", "runId": "0mvbdnit7-56eb7c54"}, "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 1}, "started_in_background": 1, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "Every response from `DashboardFiles` now carries the Content-Security-Policy header: pages, the `index.html` fallback and assets. `/api` responses don't get it. `LoopbackGuard` is untouched, so dashboard responses carry two CSP headers.\n\nI read the diff and reran the two spec checks myself. `tests/test_dashboard.py` passes (20 tests) and `uv run ruff check .` is clean. I didn't run the full test suite or the `pnpm` checks, since the spec only lists those two commands.\n\nThe change is in `src/sensei_top/api/dashboard.py`:\n- **Constant:** `CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY` sits before `_SEPARATORS` with the exact string from the spec. A comment explains each directive.\n- **Method split:** the old `get_response` body moved unchanged into `_answer`. `get_response` keeps its docstring, calls `_answer`, sets the header and returns the response.\n\nI also added a one-line docstring to `_answer`, which the spec didn't ask for.", "ttft_ms": 1242, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 7989, "uuid": "db67bda4-b4b1-43ae-b0ad-8dce19a71c05", "ttft_stream_ms": 894, "time_to_request_ms": 16, "first_content_frame_ms": 895, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
